      "test_requirement": "TARGETED",
      "test_trigger": "MVP_CRITICAL_INVARIANT",
      "test_rationale": "Critical invariant: the reported onboarding navigation control must expose its complete visible hitbox and preserve keyboard navigation. Cheaper unit or source evidence is insufficient because it cannot measure rendered geometry, so a focused signed-in browser check is required.",
