      "test_trigger": "MVP_CRITICAL_INVARIANT",
      "test_rationale": "Critical invariant: hundreds of app-wide caller migrations must preserve handlers, form types, navigation, refs, ARIA, and rendering across independent surfaces. Cheaper source evidence is insufficient, and a single targeted test is insufficient for that transitive blast radius, so focused tests plus changed-scope type, lint, React, and browser evidence are required.",
