      "test_requirement": "TARGETED",
      "test_trigger": "MVP_CRITICAL_INVARIANT",
      "test_rationale": "Critical invariant: enforcement must reject new ordinary raw buttons without rejecting specialized controls or public-owned surfaces. Cheaper static review is insufficient because it cannot prove both positive and negative classification, so deterministic fixture tests are required.",
